              "lines": [
                "# 🏀 Euroleague Player Performance — Last Week Overview\n",
                "\n",
                "This dashboard analyzes **Euroleague players** whose last game occurred within the **past 7 days**. It answers three key questions:\n",
                "\n",
                "| Chart | What it shows |\n",
                "| --- | --- |\n",
                "| **Top 5 Outliers** | Players with the *lowest* season-average similarity — meaning their last game deviated the most from their typical performance. A lower score = bigger deviation. |\n",
                "| **Worst 5 Players** | Players with the *most negative* total diff — meaning they performed well below their season average across points, rebounds, assists, and steals. |\n",
                "| **Best 5 Players** | Players with the *most positive* total diff — meaning they outperformed their season averages. |\n",
                "\n",
                "> Each player's **last game date** is shown in parentheses next to their name for quick reference.\n",
                "\n",
                "*Data source: `gold_last_game_stats` table. Stats compared: points, rebounds, assists, and steals.*"
